        {
          "text": "Mpawo Samuele wakacita mbubonya mbwaakaamba Jehova, wakaakusika ku-Betelehemu. Nkabela basinkuta bamunzi bakali kukankama kukusika kwakwe, bakati, Sa weza caluumuno? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
