        {
          "text": "Mpawo Samuele wakabweza luja lwamafuta, wakamunanika akati kabakwabo. Lino Muuya wa-Jehova wakaselukila Davida canguzu kuzwa kubuzuba obo. Nkabela Samuele wakanyamuka kuya ku-Rama.",
